      "source": "def merge_sorted_unique(a, b):\n    result = []\n    i, j = 0, 0\n    \n    while i < len(a) and j < len(b):\n        if a[i] < b[j]:\n            if a[i] not in result:\n                result.append(a[i])\n            i += 1\n        elif a[i] > b[j]:\n            if b[j] not in result:\n                result.append(b[j])\n            j += 1\n        else:\n            if a[i] not in result:\n                result.append(a[i])\n            i += 1\n            j += 1\n    \n    # Append remaining elements from both lists\n    result.extend(a[i:])\n    result.extend(b[j:])\n    \n    return result",
