      "source": "def merge_sorted_unique(a, b):\n    # Initialize pointers for both lists\n    i = j = 0\n    \n    # Initialize an empty list to store the result\n    result = []\n    \n    # Merge the two lists while both have elements\n    while i < len(a) and j < len(b):\n        if a[i] <= b[j]:\n            result.append(a[i])\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(b[j])\n            j += 1\n    \n    # Append any remaining elements from list 'a'\n    while i < len(a):\n        result.append(a[i])\n        i += 1\n    \n    # Append any remaining elements from list 'b'\n    while j < len(b):\n        result.append(b[j])\n        j += 1\n    \n    return result",
